t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">京东宣布全球开放AI技术并启动涅槃计划赋能蓝领员工技能转型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亚马逊正商谈向外部公司出售自研AI芯片Trainium以拓展算力市场</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三星电子全球推广 ChatGPT Enterprise 与 Codex 助力员工提升生产力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">诺奖得主John Jumper辞任Google DeepMind，正式加入Anthropic</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/46b262aa373f6af53201f715274722dd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2024年诺贝尔化学奖得主John Jumper于6月20日正式宣布辞去Google DeepMind职务，转投Anthropic。Jumper作为AlphaFold模型核心开发者，在结构生物学与AI融合领域具有极高影响力。此次变动发生于Google DeepMind核心人才流失背景下，此前Gemini联合负责人Noam Shazeer亦离职加入OpenAI。行业分析认为，Anthropic近期通过收购Coefficient Bio及推出Claude for Life Sciences等举措，正加速布局生命科学赛道。Jumper的加入是Anthropic在该领域的重要战略部署，旨在利用AI技术将药物研发周期压缩10倍。随着OpenAI、Google DeepMind与Anthropic在生命科学领域的竞争加剧，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信上线原生AI助手“小微”灰度测试，支持语音指令调起小程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8f5553f2aa26006ba2d5541f429271d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯近日在微信内低调开启原生AI助手“小微”的限量灰度测试。获得内测资格的用户可在微信主界面左上角点击“小微”图标，进入AI交互窗口。该助手支持文字与语音对话，具备系统级权限，可直接执行发送消息、查询朋友圈、预约服务及调起小程序等复杂指令。不同于以往通过公众号或第三方小程序接入的AI工具，“小微”作为微信生态内首个原生AI助理，实现了与微信原生功能的深度融合。腾讯客服表示，该功能目前处于早期小范围测试阶段，旨在将微信从即时通讯平台重塑为智能助手入口。随着算法与算力的持续优化，腾讯预计将在近期扩大内测范围。此次“原生AI化”转型不仅将改变十亿级用户的交互习惯，也为移动互联网生态的AI工程化落地提供了重要参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">京东宣布全球开放AI技术并启动涅槃计划赋能蓝领员工技能转型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/de6295ae976c57469aa7314bd7505888.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">京东集团创始人刘强东于2026年6月21日在APEC工商领导人中国论坛宣布，京东即日起将旗下所有AI技术向全球伙伴全面开放，旨在推动人工智能技术普惠化并打破行业技术壁垒。除技术共享外，京东正式启动“涅槃计划”，针对集团内70万名蓝领员工开展系统性职业再教育。京东将与全国120所专业院校签约，为员工提供机器人维修、精密设备保养等定制化技术培训，助力蓝领群体在智能制造环境下实现岗位转型与技能跨越。刘强东强调，企业应成为合作推动者而非技术壁垒的“筑墙者”，并指出国际化经营需扎根当地，注重长期可持续发展。此次战略布局标志着京东试图通过技术共享与人才转型并行，在全球AI生态建设中发挥更深远的影响力，同时应对技术变革带来的就业结构挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊正商谈向外部公司出售自研AI芯片Trainium以拓展算力市场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7d9edadc63c9abf5e536b8b6cc12fd1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊AI主管Peter DeSantis近日透露，公司已启动向外部企业出售自研AI专用芯片Trainium的商谈。此前，该系列芯片主要通过AWS以云计算服务形式提供。目前，亚马逊最新一代Trainium3芯片已接近售罄，而下一代Trainium4芯片正受到市场高度关注。亚马逊CEO Andy Jassy此前在股东信中指出，Trainium在云服务中的需求量激增，甚至已出现整批芯片外售的潜在需求。DeSantis强调，外售芯片策略不会冲击AWS现有的AI云业务，并认为AI算力市场仍具备巨大增长空间。在谷歌已开始交付AI ASIC硬件的背景下，亚马逊此举旨在进一步强化其在AI硬件领域的布局，直接挑战以NVIDIA为主导的AI GPU生态，加剧了高性能AI计算基础设施市场的竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三星电子全球推广 ChatGPT Enterprise 与 Codex 助力员工提升生产力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/966d11ec2d1e9035b153e6b09134c43b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三星电子近日宣布在全球范围内向员工全面推广 ChatGPT Enterprise 和 Codex，旨在通过 AI 技术提升研发、制造及市场营销等业务环节的生产力。此次部署覆盖韩国全体员工及全球设备体验（DX）部门，员工可利用 ChatGPT Enterprise 进行信息检索、文档撰写及数据分析，并在公司安全治理框架下确保数据合规。Codex 则被引入以支持软件开发及非技术团队的自动化工作流构建，助力员工将创意转化为内部工具与网站。数据显示，韩国的 Codex 活跃用户自 2026 年 2 月以来增长近 80%。OpenAI 韩国总经理金赫成表示，三星正将 AI 视为提升员工创新能力的核心平台。双方合作已从早期的 AI 基础设施内存半导体供应，扩展至企业级 AI 应用与员工转型层面。此次部署是 OpenAI 在</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
